      "side": 0,
      "message": "In arm64 and mips ELF_EXEC_PAGESIZE \u003d\u003d PAGE_SIZE\n\nhttps://elixir.bootlin.com/linux/v6.6.18/source/arch/arm64/include/asm/elf.h#L123\nhttps://elixir.bootlin.com/linux/v6.6.18/source/arch/mips/include/asm/elf.h#L414\n\nIn x86 and arm archs ELF_EXEC_PAGESIZE is always 4096, so we have PAGE_SIZE \u003e\u003d ELF_EXEC_PAGESIZE.\n\nhttps://elixir.bootlin.com/linux/v6.6.18/source/arch/x86/include/asm/elf.h#L230\nhttps://elixir.bootlin.com/linux/v6.6.18/source/arch/arm/include/asm/elf.h#L123\n\nWill architectures with ELF_EXEC_PAGESIZE \u003e PAGE_SIZE be supported after this change?",
      "parentUuid": "1f65f770_7a0b6b71",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 87,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 91,
        "endChar": 6
      },
      "revId": "966cdcc37c0d99dec557a2dc3de9fc7886fcc200",
